lors duration-300 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-60 bg-white text-ink hover:bg-brand hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-white h-10 px-5 text-[11px] hidden sm:inline-flex" href="/meridian-original/contact">Work with us</a><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-menu" class="flex h-10 items-center gap-3 rounded-full border px-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] transition-colors border-white/25 hover:border-white lg:hidden"><span aria-hidden="true" class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-[3px] transition-transform duration-300"><span class="size-[3px] rounded-full bg-current"></span><span class="size-[3px] rounded-full bg-current"></span><span class="size-[3px] rounded-full bg-current"></span><span class="size-[3px] rounded-full bg-current"></span><span class="size-[3px] rounded-full bg-current"></span><span class="size-[3px] rounded-full bg-current"></span></span><span>Menu</span></button></div></div></header><main id="main" class="flex-1"><article><header data-header-theme="dark" class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ink pb-16 pt-44 text-white md:pb-24 lg:pt-60"><div aria-hidden="true" class="starfield absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-40"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 h-full bg-[radial-gradient(60%_60%_at_70%_100%,rgba(35,64,255,0.4),transparent_75%)]"></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[90rem] px-5 md:px-8 lg:px-10"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/55"><li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/meridian-original">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li><a class="transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/meridian-original/insights">Insights</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li aria-current="page" class="text-white"><span data-mdlfy-cms="insights:6eab6307-7ed1-4398-aaf3-e5d3ff81c5e7:category">Project Cargo</span></li></ol></nav><h1 data-mdlfy-cms="insights:6eab6307-7ed1-4398-aaf3-e5d3ff81c5e7:title" class="mt-8 max-w-5xl font-heading text-[1.9rem] uppercase leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]">Planning project cargo: permits, surveys and load engineering</h1><p class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/60"><span>Published</span><time dateTime="2026-09-08">September 8, 2026</time><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-1 bg-brand-soft"></span><span>Meridian Freight team</span></p></div></header><div data-header-theme="light" class="bg-white pb-24 pt-12 md:pb-32 md:pt-16"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[90rem] px-5 md:px-8 lg:px-10"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl pt-12 md:pt-16"><p data-mdlfy-cms="insights:6eab6307-7ed1-4398-aaf3-e5d3ff81c5e7:excerpt" class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-foreground md:text-2xl">Oversized and heavy lift shipments succeed or fail in the planning stage. These are the steps that keep a complex move on schedule.</p><div class="rich-text mt-10 border-t pt-10"><p>Project cargo covers anything too large, too heavy or too complex to move as standard freight: transformers, mining equipment, modular buildings, industrial plant and more. The transport itself is often the shortest part of the job. Most of the work happens before anything is lifted.</p><h2>Start with accurate data</h2><p>Everything depends on precise dimensions, weights and centres of gravity. Drawings from the manufacturer are the starting point, and they should be confirmed against the finished item before transport plans are locked in.</p><h2>Route surveys</h2><p>For road legs, a route survey checks bridge limits, overhead clearances, turning circles and road surfaces between pickup and delivery. It shows where powerlines may need to be lifted, signs removed or traffic managed, and how long each of those steps will take.</p><h2>Permits and escorts</h2><p>Oversize and overmass loads need permits from road authorities, and many also need pilot vehicles or police escorts. Approval times vary between states and authorities, so applications should be lodged early in the planning process.</p><h2>Engineered loading</h2><p>Lift plans, lashing calculations and stowage plans make sure the cargo is secured for the forces it will face on the road, at sea or in the air. Specialist equipment such as heavy lift cranes, self-propelled modular transporters or flat rack containers is booked to match.</p><ul><li>Involve your logistics partner while the equipment is still being built.</li><li>Allow time for permit approvals in your project schedule.</li><li>Agree on site access and offloading arrangements before the cargo ships.</li></ul></div><div class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t pt-8"><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] transition-colors hover:text-brand" href="/meridian-original/insights"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left size-3.5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"></path><path d="M19 12H5"></path></svg>All insights</a><a class="group inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2.5 rounded-full font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.14em] whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-300 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-60 bg-ink text-white hover:bg-brand focus-visible:outline-ink h-10 px-5 text-[11px]" href="/meridian-original/contact">Talk to our team<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class